Runtime Dependencies (not redistributed)
==============================================================================

The backend (apps/api) and the frontend (apps/web) declare their dependencies
in apps/api/pom.xml and apps/web/package.json respectively. Those packages are
resolved at build time and are not vendored into this repository. Each remains
under its own license; consult the respective package metadata for details.

The HarmonyOS client (apps/huawei, apps/huaweiweb) declares its dependencies in
the corresponding oh-package.json5 files.
